Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.79,0:00:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I love young women! Let me gobble them up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.54,0:00:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, just go see a prostitute.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for protecting me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.43,0:00:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.41,0:00:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your palms are sweaty. Gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.12,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, {\i1}I{\i0} might look good in a flower garden like this,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a fatty like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.69,0:02:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it. More haste, less speed.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.19,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.23,0:02:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.61,0:02:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ura-Acca, {show some concern}say something too.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.74,0:02:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.45,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does it hurt?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My ribs hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.21,0:02:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're broken.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.87,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A doctor should—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.38,0:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They never told me my body {\i1}here{\i0} would get hurt!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.84,0:03:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, but that's none of our concern.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.01,0:03:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}your{\i0} responsibility.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.01,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awful!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get used to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.56,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Adults suck, even in this place.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.07,0:03:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.57,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kawai Rika. Like "kawaii," 'cause I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saving a friend, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those color contacts?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.67,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool idea, mixing colors.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.42,0:03:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That might go viral.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.42,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it bother you? Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.47,0:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you spot me cash?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.93,0:03:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.26,0:03:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't tell me the second one would cost money.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I most certainly did.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.94,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pain to go back for my wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I'll pay you back!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.07,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.70,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, okay, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.49,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She will, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.79,0:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.75,0:04:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come see {Rika}me again, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.75,0:04:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A handshake event?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.79,0:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know where I live?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.13,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-kyun, Ai-Ai, A-chan, Ai-ty, Aijorina.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.43,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do people call you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ohto."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really have a nickname.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.35,0:05:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... so {it's like that}that's how it is, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed you yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, to pay me back for—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.81,0:05:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I forgot my wallet again.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.44,0:05:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know someone in here?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.07,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Her name's Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.99,0:05:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Neiru's {\i1}nailed{\i0} down in bed?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.62,0:05:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rush your rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to give your body time to rest,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll only make things worse.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still young.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.26,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put too much confidence in youth.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.98,0:06:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.06,0:06:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.29,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it with this.{"this time" or something?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.66,0:06:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kawai Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.93,0:06:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I met her buying Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.59,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.38,0:06:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember it as {\i1}Kawaii{\i0} Rika, since I'm so super cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A tsundere, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.77,0:06:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to form a unit with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.77,0:06:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be a junior idol.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A group called All-Out Kiss. Ever heard of us?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.90,0:06:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.61,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We broke up. All the others were too ugly.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.03,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. The two of us might get popular.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I love kiwi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.59,0:07:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nice legs.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.60,0:07:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna be a backup dancer?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.39,0:07:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Backup?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.95,0:07:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.87,0:07:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.53,0:07:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.99,0:07:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.45,0:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kawai Rika. Like "kawaii," because I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.33,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home. A friend of yours?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.84,0:07:56.30,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll leave for today, since I see you have company.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.80,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.30,0:08:01.14,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.14,0:08:03.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Don't be. It's no trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.41,0:08:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one good-looking daddy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.77,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Thank you for always coming by.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.77,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not my dad.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.81,0:08:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.85,0:08:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you some roll cake later.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.32,0:08:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your school counselor? Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.99,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, you're a shut-in?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.82,0:08:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Since this semester started.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're out for attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.45,0:08:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get your hot \Ncounselor to worry about you, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.79,0:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because Koito died.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She was my only friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it with the depressing talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.13,0:08:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll spoil the cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.56,0:08:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you trying to save your friend—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.69,0:08:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.85,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my fan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.19,0:08:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My little wallet who'd buy me anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.27,0:08:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your "wallet"?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy says a beautiful woman doesn't need a wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.53,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will always offer to pay for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he got divorced.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.99,0:09:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll pay you back for the Egg. Promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.00,0:09:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.34,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Wow, it looks delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.67,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, I buy these roll cakes all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.13,0:09:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been short on cash since Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.55,0:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm gonna save her and get my wallet back.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.72,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi's ugly and a real fatty.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She has gross, sweaty palms, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.40,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Way too embarrassing to call a friend, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.53,0:09:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You pick your friends based on looks?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna eat that?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.71,0:09:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.00,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.00,0:10:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Koito girl cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.34,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.76,0:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,More "pretty" than "cute."
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.51,0:10:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.64,0:10:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru is cool, but Koito was more gentle and soft.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.77,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She was graceful and innocent, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.31,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It was looks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.57,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.07,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh. That's cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.60,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.53,0:10:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grab a towel.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.04,0:10:40.63,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai, lend me some pajamas!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.72,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Did you call your parents?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.64,0:11:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about her?{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.22,0:11:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch the surface, and she's all slimy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.73,0:11:37.98,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Everyone is.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.69,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Long baths will give you dry skin.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.91,0:11:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cut anymore. I promised.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito, is club...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.90,0:12:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.83,0:12:43.75,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Why, Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.09,0:12:46.09,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Was it because of Mr. Sawaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.89,0:12:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You don't look too good in a flower garden either.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.31,0:13:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that's my little wallet Chiemi over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.90,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks a little thinner from over here.{this distance maybe?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.40,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You synchronized.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We what?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.24,0:13:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell asleep near each other \Nand at almost the same time, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.25,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We synchronized.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.17,0:13:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But why aren't we in my dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.42,0:13:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pulled by whoever's feelings are stronger.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.72,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,That can't be it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.72,0:13:33.09,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,She calls her friend her "wallet"! How could—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.09,0:13:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Crack them on "go"?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.64,0:13:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, go.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.27,0:13:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Miko!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.48,0:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.65,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're here! You're here! I got to see you again!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.98,0:13:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.65,0:13:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're huge fans of Yu-Yu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We went to meet-ups and concerts and things.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Yu-Yu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A singer who committed suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.70,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're huge Yu-Yu fans.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.70,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we followed Yu-Yu and died as fast as we could.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy or casual.{ugh}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.42,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's basically the way fanatical fans are.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, for now, we just have to...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep these girls safe until sunset.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.26,0:14:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The bystanders?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.14,0:14:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here. There's a swimming beach down below.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?! They're adorbs!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.82,0:14:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky. I wish we could swap.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.62,0:14:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That way!{over there?}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.51,0:14:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.59,0:14:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.14,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's your fault for standing there.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to go that way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.89,0:15:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.85,0:15:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what is it now?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.94,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.20,0:15:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.05,0:15:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be hard to fight in the open.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.64,0:15:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cuts aren't healing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.80,0:16:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry. These are old.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.59,0:16:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a youthful whatever.{ah yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, show's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.10,0:16:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about Chiemi for real.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.77,0:16:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Handshake events for unpopular idols are surreal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.32,0:16:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few people lining up over and over.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.40,0:16:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi was a real idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.95,0:16:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She got in line for me dozens, maybe hundreds of times.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.95,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She just gave me all her allowance \Nand New Year's money with a smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.17,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed I had a rich patron.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.46,0:16:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I saw her shoplifting in town.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd been selling what she {took}stole.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.31,0:17:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally know that feeling.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.90,0:17:14.31,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got sugar daddies for the same reason.{uhh}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.31,0:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.61,0:17:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I told her I'd never be friends with a fan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.82,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd be too embarrassed to be \Nseen with a fatty in the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.16,0:17:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, "Never come back."
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, another fan told me what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.21,0:17:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.67,0:17:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She was skin and bones, like a mummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.38,0:17:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget her if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.22,0:17:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Chiemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.47,0:17:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.73,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means I can see Chiemi again,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill as many as it takes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.65,0:18:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.51,0:18:29.71,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.35,0:18:33.19,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There was a part of me that resented her.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.73,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We were friends, so why didn't she talk to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.73,0:18:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.28,0:18:46.39,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If she'd asked me to die with her, like those girls did...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.82,0:18:48.78,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.50,0:18:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.81,0:19:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.73,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them with you.{I'll help you kill them?}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.50,0:19:35.78,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I wanted to die with her, too. To chase after Yu-Yu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.41,0:19:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrapping people up? Is this S&M?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.55,0:19:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman got arrested for stalking Yu-Yu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.75,0:19:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachiko, the Asagaya Madame!{asagayama wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachiko...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.42,0:19:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You get them everywhere. Delusional \Nweirdos who cross the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.05,0:19:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see Yu-Yu because you're all so noisy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.22,0:19:52.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,It hurts. It hurts. It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.39,0:19:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Yu doesn't care about little \Nbrats; Yu-Yu likes mature women!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.40,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.20,0:20:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.96,0:20:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We protect these girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,From monsters.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're promoted from backup dancer.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.60,0:20:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Little girls!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.93,0:20:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,People won't fawn over you forever, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.44,0:20:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we won't end up like you, lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in a million years.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.15,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.23,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.03,0:20:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I... can't move.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.54,0:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.21,0:20:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.63,0:21:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.39,0:21:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.52,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued!
